  "worked_solution": "Notice that the vertex of $∠SOT$ is point $O,$ not point $T.$ So $∠SOT$ is *not* a straight angle.\n\nWe can think of $∠SOT$ as:\n\n- a *null* angle, if we assume that it doesn't turn at all (diagram on the left), or\n\n- a *full* angle, if we assume that it makes one full turn (diagram on the right).\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14131901/assets/bd3002843b8a0542d17604da7360d60a180e87b6a4f2c1f9e26476ad761a49f7.png)\n\nSo, the answer is 'Null' or 'Full'.",
